      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠢᠨᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>sinuqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>шунах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SINU-</transcript>
      <definition>[= sinura-] v. i. To feel a strong desire or craving, yearn; to give oneself up to be lascivious; to burn with passion.</definition>
      <page>713</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠨᠢᠭᠡ ᠶᠠᠭᠤᠮ᠎ᠠ ᠰᠢᠨᠣᠵᠤᠬᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>egyn dyr nige jayum-a -- zuxui</transcript>
          <definition> Something must have possessed him.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠣᠯᠵᠠ ᠮᠥᠩᠭᠦᠨ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠰᠢᠨᠣᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>olza mønggyn dyr --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To covet; be greedy for profit.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠥᠩᠭᠡᠨ ᠎ᠳᠦ ᠰᠢᠨᠣᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>ønggen dy --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To give oneself up to women, be addicted to lust.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
